flowchart TB
  failure["Failure: retain caller, action and resource"]
  access-denial{"Explicit access denial?"}
  stop-denial["Stop; no protected data"]
  recoverable{"Known recoverable operational failure?"}
  stop-failure["Stop safely; no protected data"]
  propose["Propose fallback for the same operation"]
  authority["Execution identity grants no extra caller entitlement"]
  authorize{"Fallback permitted for original caller under policy?"}
  stop-fallback["Stop; no protected data"]
  execute["Execute only permitted scoped fallback"]
  response["Return only caller-permitted data"]
  failure --> access-denial
  access-denial -->|Yes| stop-denial
  access-denial -->|No| recoverable
  recoverable -->|No or unknown| stop-failure
  recoverable -->|Yes| propose
  propose --> authority
  authority --> authorize
  authorize -->|Denied or indeterminate| stop-fallback
  authorize -->|Permitted| execute
  execute --> response
